<!--
  098-dialect-overlay, contracts/witnesses.md W-1: the small Orchestra triple
  base.xml, overlay.xml and edited.xml. edited.xml is base.xml with each
  overlay.xml addition appended at the end of its matched container, after
  that container's last child element, in overlay document order (spec.md
  Terminology, "Equivalent edited XML"; research R-3's Orchestra table),
  written by hand and never produced by the merge (FR-017 (a)). Re-check it
  with a no-index unified diff of base.xml against edited.xml: every hunk has
  one of the shapes contracts W-1 allows, the Required promotion in its
  Orchestra form being a presence attribute set to required. The header and
  trailer are components 1024 and 1025, referenced from each message's
  structure. TextCodeSet lists no code, so Text has no enum domain until the
  overlay lists one (N-2). Group Events holds only the empty component
  EmptyBlock, a group whose members emit nothing, which the loader refuses
  under the default unresolved_group_policy; so base.xml is never loaded on
  its own, and the member the overlay appends to Events is its first
  emission, its delimiter (spec.md Edge Cases).
-->
